  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pre finance AC chargers</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DGGF Pre-finance will be used to purchase sub components, and assemble and deliver BRIGHTBLU&#x2019;s Jolt Business AC chargers to their client. BRIGHTBLU develops vehicle charging technology designed to offer charging services for electric vehicles at home, office, in town and on the road. The company&apos;s technology consists of hardware, cloud-enabled services and support for drivers of electric vehicles, enabling users to track their charging status, remotely monitor their charging and settle charging costs. Solutions are extensively tested to conquer Indian though conditions, including weather and power disruptions. BRIGHTBLU&#x2019;s short-term ambition is to capture the Charge Point Operator (CPO) market, penetrate the OEM market and in-house technology development to enter the DC charging market. Medium-term ambition is to grow to other countries/markets over time, including The Netherlands.</narrative>
  </description>
